/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 556 0 R
/T (Diagram description: The agent loop is a cycle of five stages. Perception receives and preprocesses input. Reasoning/Planning uses the LLM to decide the next action. Action executes that decision \(tool call, memory write, or direct response\). Observation captures the result of the action. Evaluation checks whether the goal is met -if not, control returns to Perception for another iteration; if yes, the agent returns its final answer. )
/E (Diagram description: The agent loop is a cycle of five stages. Perception receives and preprocesses input. Reasoning/Planning uses the LLM to decide the next action. Action executes that decision \(tool call, memory write, or direct response\). Observation captures the result of the action. Evaluation checks whether the goal is met -if not, control returns to Perception for another iteration; if yes, the agent returns its final answer. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
