1102 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 564 0 R
/T (Diagram description: Input enters through the Perception Layer, which preprocesses it and passes it to the Reasoning Engine. The Reasoning Engine collaborates bidirectionally with the Memory System \(reading context and writing new observations\) and with the Planning Component \(receiving sub-tasks, returning updated goals\). When the Reasoning Engine decides on an action, the Action Layer executes it -feeding the tool result back into Perception for the next iteration and forwarding the execution result to the Evaluation Component. The Evaluator either sends a reflection back to the Reasoning Engine for another iteration, or -when the goal is met -terminates the loop and emits the Final Response.)
/E (Diagram description: Input enters through the Perception Layer, which preprocesses it and passes it to the Reasoning Engine. The Reasoning Engine collaborates bidirectionally with the Memory System \(reading context and writing new observations\) and with the Planning Component \(receiving sub-tasks, returning updated goals\). When the Reasoning Engine decides on an action, the Action Layer executes it -feeding the tool result back into Perception for the next iteration and forwarding the execution result to the Evaluation Component. The Evaluator either sends a reflection back to the Reasoning Engine for another iteration, or -when the goal is met -terminates the loop and emits the Final Response.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
