/T (A common pattern is to reserve a fixed token budget for each category and enforce it at the Perception Layer before assembling the final prompt. When a category exceeds its budget, the oldest or least-relevant content is evicted -either discarded or written to Episodic Memory for later retrieval. )
/E (A common pattern is to reserve a fixed token budget for each category and enforce it at the Perception Layer before assembling the final prompt. When a category exceeds its budget, the oldest or least-relevant content is evicted -either discarded or written to Episodic Memory for later retrieval. )
