/T (RAG solves this by augmenting the LLM's generation with dynamically retrieved, up-to-date, domain-specific content. The pattern has two phases:)
/E (RAG solves this by augmenting the LLM's generation with dynamically retrieved, up-to-date, domain-specific content. The pattern has two phases:)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [11]
