/T (Hybrid retrieval combines exact keyword matching \(BM25 or TF-IDF\) with semantic similarity search, then merges and re-ranks the results. This captures both lexically precise matches \(exact product names, error codes, proper nouns\) and semantically related content that may use different terminology. Most production RAG systems use hybrid retrieval because it consistently outperforms either approach alone.)
