/T (Output Size limits prevent oversized tool results from flooding the context window. Before injecting a tool result into the prompt, check its token count. If it exceeds the budget, truncate it, summarize it, or extract only the relevant portions. A 50,000-token API response injected wholesale into a 128K context window leaves little room for anything else.)
/E (Output Size limits prevent oversized tool results from flooding the context window. Before injecting a tool result into the prompt, check its token count. If it exceeds the budget, truncate it, summarize it, or extract only the relevant portions. A 50,000-token API response injected wholesale into a 128K context window leaves little room for anything else.)
/Pg 61 0 R
