/T (The Model Context Protocol \(MCP\) is an open standard, introduced by Anthropic in late 2024, designed to solve this interoperability problem. MCP defines a common protocol for how AI models and agents discover, describe, and invoke tools -regardless of the underlying framework, model provider, or tool implementation.)
/E (The Model Context Protocol \(MCP\) is an open standard, introduced by Anthropic in late 2024, designed to solve this interoperability problem. MCP defines a common protocol for how AI models and agents discover, describe, and invoke tools -regardless of the underlying framework, model provider, or tool implementation.)
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [13]
>>
