/P 615 0 R
/T (For most multi-agent systems, start with request-response for simplicity. Introduce a shared blackboard when agents need to collaborate on a shared artifact. Reach for a message queue only when you need asynchronous processing, high throughput, or resilience to agent failures. Each step up in communication complexity adds operational overhead -make sure the problem warrants it.)
/E (For most multi-agent systems, start with request-response for simplicity. Introduce a shared blackboard when agents need to collaborate on a shared artifact. Reach for a message queue only when you need asynchronous processing, high throughput, or resilience to agent failures. Each step up in communication complexity adds operational overhead -make sure the problem warrants it.)
/Pg 78 0 R
/K [10]
>>
