/S /H2
/P 616 0 R
/T (Mitigation: implement delegation depth limits \(a maximum number of levels an agent can delegate before being required to return a result or escalate to a human\).)
/E (Mitigation: implement delegation depth limits \(a maximum number of levels an agent can delegate before being required to return a result or escalate to a human\).)
/Pg 79 0 R
/K [11]
>>
