2299 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 622 0 R
/T (Diagram Description: Input enters at the top and passes through four sequential layers. Each layer either passes the content to the next layer or blocks it, routing to a "Blocked / Escalated" terminal. Layer 1 validates and sanitizes input. Layer 2 constrains the planning process. Layer 3 enforces action boundaries at execution time. Layer 4 verifies the output before it is delivered. A failure at any layer stops the pipeline. )
/E (Diagram Description: Input enters at the top and passes through four sequential layers. Each layer either passes the content to the next layer or blocks it, routing to a "Blocked / Escalated" terminal. Layer 1 validates and sanitizes input. Layer 2 constrains the planning process. Layer 3 enforces action boundaries at execution time. Layer 4 verifies the output before it is delivered. A failure at any layer stops the pipeline. )
/Pg 85 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
