/E (Prompt injection via indirect channels \(retrieved web content, processed documents, tool outputs\) is an active and evolving threat. Do not assume that instruction boundary markers or system prompt instructions are sufficient on their own. Treat indirect injection as an unsolved problem and apply multiple independent mitigations. Monitor agent outputs for anomalous behavior that may indicate a successful injection.)
