<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 639 0 R
/T (Standard application monitoring is built around a simple model: a request arrives, code executes deterministically, a response is returned. The execution path is fixed; the only variables are latency and error rate. Monitoring this system means watching those two numbers. )
/E (Standard application monitoring is built around a simple model: a request arrives, code executes deterministically, a response is returned. The execution path is fixed; the only variables are latency and error rate. Monitoring this system means watching those two numbers. )
/Pg 102 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
