/T (Multi-Step, Nested Causality - A failure in step 7 of a 12-step agent run may have been caused by a bad tool result in step 3. Standard request logs show you the final error; they do not show you the causal chain.)
/E (Multi-Step, Nested Causality - A failure in step 7 of a 12-step agent run may have been caused by a bad tool result in step 3. Standard request logs show you the final error; they do not show you the causal chain.)
/Pg 103 0 R
