endobj
2857 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 647 0 R
/E (Automated evaluation of agent outputs is a hard problem. Traditional software testing compares outputs to expected values -but agent outputs are natural language, and natural language does not have a single correct form. A response can be correct, partially correct, correct but verbose, correct but in the wrong format, or subtly wrong in ways that only a domain expert would notice. )
/Pg 110 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
