/T (The budget is checked before each LLM call. If the budget is exhausted, the agent raises a controlled exception, persists its current state, and returns a partial result with a clear explanation to the user. This is preferable to letting the agent run until it hits an API quota limit or produces an unexpectedly large bill.)
