/P 666 0 R
/T (For agents that take real-world actions \(sending emails, modifying databases, calling external APIs\), staged autonomy grants provide a safe path from supervised to autonomous operation. Rather than deploying a fully autonomous agent immediately, the agent is deployed in a supervised mode where all actions require human approval. As the agent demonstrates reliable behavior on a category of actions, autonomy is granted for that category -the agent can take those actions without approval. Autonomy is expanded incrementally, category by category, as confidence is established.)
/E (For agents that take real-world actions \(sending emails, modifying databases, calling external APIs\), staged autonomy grants provide a safe path from supervised to autonomous operation. Rather than deploying a fully autonomous agent immediately, the agent is deployed in a supervised mode where all actions require human approval. As the agent demonstrates reliable behavior on a category of actions, autonomy is granted for that category -the agent can take those actions without approval. Autonomy is expanded incrementally, category by category, as confidence is established.)
/Pg 129 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
