/T (Every deployment uses a specific version bundle. The bundle is stored in version control alongside the agent code. When a new version is deployed, the bundle is updated atomically you never deploy a new prompt with an old tool schema, or a new model with an old prompt. )
/E (Every deployment uses a specific version bundle. The bundle is stored in version control alongside the agent code. When a new version is deployed, the bundle is updated atomically you never deploy a new prompt with an old tool schema, or a new model with an old prompt. )
