/Title (Short-lived agents - those that complete a task in a single run of a few seconds -can hold all state in memory. Long-running agents - those that execute over minutes, hours, or days, or that span multiple user sessions - require durable state management. Without it, a process restart, a network partition, or a timeout causes the agent to lose all progress and restart from scratch.)
/Dest [134 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 10497 0 R
/Next 10547 0 R
>>
