/Next 10599 0 R
>>
endobj
10599 0 obj
<<
/Title (Without explicit plan revision logic, agents can get stuck in unproductive loops -repeatedly attempting the same failing action because the plan was never updated to reflect the failure. Always design the Planning Component with a mechanism to detect stalled progress and trigger replanning or escalation.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 10587 0 R
/Prev 10598 0 R
/First 10609 0 R
/Last 10609 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
