/Title (Prompt templates are equally important to pin. A prompt stored as a mutable string in a database can be edited by anyone with database access, changing the agent's behavior without a deployment. Store prompt templates in version control, reference them by hash or version tag, and treat prompt changes as code changes -with review, testing, and deployment.)
