/Title (Error handling is a first-class concern in the Action Layer. Tool calls fail -APIs return errors, code throws exceptions, network requests time out. The Action Layer must decide how to handle each failure: retry with backoff, try an alternative tool, return a structured error to the Reasoning Engine so it can replan, or escalate to a human. Unhandled tool failures are one of the most common causes of agent loops getting stuck or producing incorrect results.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 10602 0 R
/Prev 10626 0 R
/Next 10627 0 R
>>
endobj
