/Title (Self-assessment is the Evaluation Component's core function. After each action and observation, the evaluator asks: does the current state satisfy the goal? Is the output correct, complete, and consistent with the task requirements? This assessment may be performed by the LLM itself \(prompted to evaluate its own output\), by a separate evaluator model, by deterministic checks \(does the output match a schema? does the code pass tests?\), or by a combination of all three.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 10615 0 R
/Prev 10629 0 R
/Next 10651 0 R
>>
