10642 0 obj
<<
/Title (Self-correction is the Evaluation Component's most powerful capability. When evaluation finds the output lacking -incorrect facts, incomplete steps, failed tool calls -the evaluator generates a critique and feeds it back to the Reasoning Engine as a new observation. The agent then revises its plan or output in light of the critique. This reflection loop can dramatically improve output quality, but it also adds latency and token cost, so it should be applied selectively.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
