/Title (Token budgets should be set per-run, not per-session or per-day. A per-day budget does not protect you from a single runaway agent run that consumes your entire daily allocation in one invocation. Set a per-run budget that reflects the expected cost of the task, with a reasonable safety margin, and enforce it at the agent loop level.)
