/Title (Function calling is the most common form. The LLM outputs a structured request -a tool name and a set of typed arguments -and the agent runtime executes the corresponding function. The function might be a local utility \(format a date, parse a URL\), a database query, or a wrapper around any other capability. The result is returned to the agent as an observation.)
