/Title (Never grant an agent more tool permissions than it needs for its current task. The principle of least privilege applies directly to agent tool access. An agent with write access to a production database that only needs read access is an unnecessary risk. Scope tool permissions to the minimum required for the task, and revoke them when the task is complete.)
