/Title (A single agent executes sequentially -one reasoning step at a time. Many real world tasks are naturally parallel: research ten competitors simultaneously, run five code review agents on different modules, or process a batch of documents concurrently. Multi agent systems unlock horizontal scaling by running independent sub-tasks in parallel, reducing wall-clock time dramatically.)
