11659 0 obj
<<
/Title (When multiple agents work on related sub-tasks and their outputs are aggregated, conflicts are inevitable. Two research agents may find contradictory information. Two code agents may produce implementations that cannot be merged. Without a conflict resolution strategy, the aggregator must either pick one arbitrarily or return both -neither of which is satisfactory.)
/Dest [80 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 11650 0 R
/Next 11665 0 R
>>
endobj
11660 0 obj
<<
/Title (ChiefSense)
/Dest [83 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 11650 0 R
/Prev 11665 0 R
/First 11666 0 R
/Last 11667 0 R
/Count -2
>>
endobj
11661 0 obj
<<
/Title (Safety and Guardrails)
/Dest [83 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 11650 0 R
/First 11668 0 R
