11683 0 obj
<<
/Title (Indirect Injection - adversarial instructions are embedded in external content the agent retrieves or processes \(a web page, a database record, an email body\). The agent processes the content as data but the LLM interprets the embedded instructions as commands.)
/Dest [85 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 11674 0 R
/Prev 11682 0 R
>>
