11689 0 obj
<<
/Title (Diagram Description: Input enters at the top and passes through four sequential layers. Each layer either passes the content to the next layer or blocks it, routing to a "Blocked / Escalated" terminal. Layer 1 validates and sanitizes input. Layer 2 constrains the planning process. Layer 3 enforces action boundaries at execution time. Layer 4 verifies the output before it is delivered. A failure at any layer stops the pipeline.)
/Dest [85 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 11681 0 R
/Prev 11688 0 R
/First 11696 0 R
/Last 11696 0 R
/Count -1
>>
